# Store text with LF line endings in the repository, whatever each person's
# editor uses. Without this, a commit from a Windows checkout rewrote every
# line of every file it touched, which buried real changes in the diff and
# made merges between contributors fail on nothing.
* text=auto

# Never touch these.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
